  "description": "LABDIC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H210 Dy10 O60. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.789-3.808 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.08-112.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Dy10(OC2H4OCH3)30.",
